  placement: auto,
  fig("fig.fig4-overlap", width: 100%),
  caption: [
    Protein-level agreement at 1% entrapment FDR on the six primary datasets.
    *(a)* Every pairwise Jaccard index within uno, between the engines, and
    within ms1searchpy. *(b)* Each uno seed's recovery of the intersection of
    all available ms1searchpy lists for that file. Open circles are individual
